---
title: Pattern - strategy (interfaces with one swappable implementation each; object diagram)
---
flowchart TB
    subgraph AI["AI agent strategy: IAgentService"]
        direction LR
        LC["<u>leadsController : LeadsController</u><br>CreateLead(dto, [FromServices] IAgentService)"]
        IA{{"«interface» IAgentService<br>ProcessLeadAsync(leadData)"}}
        GA["<u>agent : GeminiAgentService</u><br>Gemini:Url = ...gemini-1.5-flash:generateContent<br>Gemini:ApiKey = (empty in repo)"]
        R1["<u>result : AgentResponse</u><br>Status = Success<br>ExtractedData = {status, reason}"]
        R2["<u>result : AgentResponse</u><br>Status = Fallback<br>no key, HTTP error or timeout"]
        LEAD["<u>lead : Lead</u><br>TriageStatus = parsed status, or NeedsReview<br>TriageReason = reason or null"]
        LC --> IA
        IA -. implemented by .-> GA
        GA --> R1
        GA --> R2
        R1 --> LEAD
        R2 -->|fallback| LEAD
    end

    subgraph MAIL["Email strategy: IEmailService"]
        direction LR
        AC["<u>authController : AuthController</u><br>ForgotPassword"]
        IE{{"«interface» IEmailService"}}
        SE["<u>emailService : SmtpEmailService</u><br>Smtp:Host empty = log only (simulated)"]
        AC --> IE
        IE -. implemented by .-> SE
    end

    subgraph TOK["Refresh token store strategy: IRefreshTokenStore"]
        direction LR
        AU["<u>authService : AuthService</u>"]
        IR{{"«interface» IRefreshTokenStore"}}
        IM["<u>refreshStore : InMemoryRefreshTokenStore</u><br>tokens lost on restart; one instance only"]
        AU --> IR
        IR -. implemented by .-> IM
    end

    note1["Only one implementation exists for each interface.<br>Checklist and Summarisation agents (AgentType enum) are not built,<br>and nothing writes AgentRun rows."]
    AI ~~~ MAIL ~~~ TOK ~~~ note1
